WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.712
Got P&IDs? Drop the whole drawing set into AquaMesh.

2
00:00:05.762 --> 00:00:07.319
It reads every sheet:

3
00:00:07.319 --> 00:00:11.248
the equipment, every instrument, and what feeds what.

4
00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:17.052
Your engineer checks it, fixes anything that's off, and marks it checked.

5
00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:22.735
That checked plant model is what the live digital twin is built on.

6
00:00:22.735 --> 00:00:25.880
So the twin matches the plant you actually run.

